| riscos-n64 test run: Obey run-test <rom> <tag> <emumode 0|1|2> <VIs> [<gfx plugin>]
| Arguments after the 5th go to mupen64plus. ROM from roms/, results in out/: <tag>-log (hashes), <tag>-png (framebuffer at VI 120),
| <tag>-stdout, <tag>-stderr. Dummy video, audio and input unless a gfx plugin is given.
| Sound: add --audio mupen64plus-audio-sdl. VIs 0 runs until the window is closed. Speed limiter off unless N64_LIMIT is set. Saves and caches go in user/ (XDG dirs, relative).
Dir <Obey$Dir>
If "<N64_LIMIT>"="" Then Set N64_NOLIMIT 1 Else Set N64_NOLIMIT 0
Set N64_QUITVI %3
Set N64_HASHLOG out/%1-log
Set N64_VITIMES out/%1-vit
Set N64_PROFILE out/%1-prof
Set N64_SHOT 120:out/%1-120.png
RMEnsure StreamManager 0.03 RMLoad System:Modules.StreamMan
RMEnsure SharedSoundBuffer 0.07 RMLoad System:Modules.SSBuffer
Set XDG_DATA_HOME user
Set XDG_CACHE_HOME user
WimpSlot -min 200000K -max 200000K
Run @.mupen64plus --noosd --configdir cfg --datadir data --gfx %4 --audio dummy --input dummy --rsp mupen64plus-rsp-hle --emumode %2 %*5 roms/%0 > out/%1.stdout 2> out/%1.stderr
